<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC cuts some cash bond rates 1/4 point.</title>
<headline>SBC cuts some cash bond rates 1/4 point.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it had cut some cash bond rates, effective February 12. The rates are:</p>
<p>  Maturity		     new rate	   old rate</p>
<p> Two years			1.75 pct	   1.75 pct</p>
<p> Three years		    2.25		 2.25</p>
<p> Four years		     2.5		  2.75</p>
<p> Five years		     2.75		 3.0</p>
<p> Six years			3.0		  3.25</p>
<p> Seven years		    3.25		 3.5</p>
<p> Eight years		    3.5		  3.75</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
